<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[515, 473, 910, 500]]<|/det|>
Firstly, we will show how we can reproduce the GPT- 3 and achieve comparable performance.  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[515, 500, 912, 582]]<|/det|>
We follow the training procedure of quality classifier in GPT3 [9] that used a logistic regression classifier with features from standard tokenizer and HashingTF of PySpark. Based on this, we expand this training pipeline to Chinese text and various code types. The training details are listed in Table 6, where the keeping method includes:  

<|ref|>text<|/ref|><|det|>[[543, 585, 707, 598]]<|/det|>
